X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Asheville.com": "https://www.asheville.com/event/southeastern-animal-fiber-fair-4"}
X-SOURCE-ID:asheville_com
SUMMARY:Southeastern Animal Fiber Fair
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261023T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261025T170000
UID:e309dd26e0b419a34381af29d41306d4@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Cost: Admission will be $5/person per day. $10 pass for 3 days
 . Youth under 13 yrs. old will be free. Cash only!. Join us for 3 days of 
 fun for the entire family! Hours are 9 to 5 pm on Friday and Saturday. 9 t
 o 4 pm on Sunday. See spinning\, knitting\, weaving\, felting and much mor
 e! Join a workshop class to improve your skills or just enjoy browsing and
  shopping the beautiful and unique apparel and wearables.
LOCATION:WNC Agricultural Center\, 1301 Fanning Bridge Rd\, Fletcher\, NC 
 28732
URL:https://www.asheville.com/event/southeastern-animal-fiber-fair-4
X-SOURCE:Asheville.com, Hendersonville.com
END:VEVENT
