SUMMARY:Pups & Pints w/ Shady Grove Stringband
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Bluegrass and Brews\, and bring your dog friends! 11-2 at the corner of Market and Eagle streets downtown. \n🍁 Fall is officially here… and we can’t think of a better way to celebrate than with Pups and Pints! 🍻🐶🐕‍🦺 \nKick off the season with us at Pups and Pints on Saturday\, from 11am-2pm on the corner of Eagle Street and S. Market Street! \nBring your four-legged friend and enjoy:\nLocal pet friendly vendors\nComplimentary pet caricatures\nPet photography\nLive Bluegrass with the Shady Grove Stringband\nFood\nAnd giveaways! \nEnjoy this dog friendly event all in support of Asheville Humane Society 💙🐶
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/shady-grove-stringband/
LOCATION:21 Eagle Street\, Asheville
