SUMMARY:AVLH3 #870 - Hashing Into the Sunset (Allegedly)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Hash House Harriers (AVLH3)\n🌅 LATE-BREAKING TRAI
 L ALERT 🌅\nHashing Into the Sunset (Allegedly)\nNobody else wanted it\,
  so your Saturday hares are Crotches (aka Flipper) and Sicilian Family Por
 trait. Let's just say this trail was planned in haste.\nWe're chasing the 
 sunset to the top of something in North Asheville. Where? That's for us to
  know and you to stagger toward. Experts are calling it a "spectacularly s
 hitty sunset." Clouds? Haze? An uninspiring smear of beige? Nobody knows. 
 You'll be up there anyway\, holding a beer\, looking west\, pretending it'
 s gorgeous.\n📍 **Start/Finish:** Weaver Park\, North Asheville (A-A as 
 stuttering Canadians say) probably. Updates to follow.\n🕔 **Hares away:
 ** 5:00 PM sharp. Pack away around 5:15.\n🌇 **Sunset:** 6:43 PM. Get on
  top or miss it.\n🍺 **Beer stops:** One plus something else. The hares 
 haven't decided and frankly may not before Saturday.\n🌶️ Chili Stop? 
 Maybe!\n📏 **Distance:** About 4 miles\, with a hill at the end because 
 we're hares\, not monsters... okay\, we're a little bit monsters.\n🔦 **
 Bring**: A flashlight (or a fleshlight\; we're not here to judge\, but onl
 y one helps on the way down in the dark). Plus layers\, since it'll drop i
 nto the 40s after sundown.\n⚠️ The hares reserve the right to emulsify
  this trail and change anything at any time\, for any reason or no reason 
 at all.\nCum for the sunset. On-on! 🤙
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avlh3-on-on/events/317076626/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261021T172507Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T172507Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
