 n this FREE evening session for Meditation\, specifically for Moms.\n\nAbo
 ut this Event\nWe are creating this Meditation space for moms 💟 that ca
 n help\n🤲 create a supportive community of moms who can come together a
 nd meditate\n🤲 build a meditation routine\n🤲 implement self-care\, a
 nd take pause in hectic lives\n🤲 bring calmness and balance that can re
 flect on kids and household\n🤲 share experiences and learn to grow in t
 his journey together\n\nJoin this FREE evening session for Meditation\, sp
 ecifically for Moms. Meditation is a simple way to de-stress\, and it can 
