SUMMARY:Zillicoah Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Beer Drinkers\, Happy Hours & Bar Hoppers\nWe will b
 e at Zillicoah Brewery on Riverside Dr on Wednesday night\, October 28th. 
 It's just North of the junction of Broadway and Riverside Dr at the UNC ex
 it off I-26. Riverside Dr and Broadway\, are both friendlier drives than I
 -26 at 5:30\, but it's only one exit North of 240 if you use I-26. I reall
 y like this brewery\, and I think that many of you will too. It sets right
  on the river\, and may remind some of you of the old Bywater\, with nice 
 outdoor grounds and picnic tables on the lawn. We will be meeting inside\,
  but you'll get the feel of the place. I hope to see some of you there on 
 Tuesday night. They do advertise a food truck on site.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-beer-drinkers/events/317096
 169/
