DESCRIPTION:Join Fiber Arts crew 10/28 from 4-6pm to create a heatable weig
 hted pillow! With many designs to choose from\, make an owl\, an eye pillo
 w\, a classic rectangle\, or whatever shape of your choosing! Weighted ite
 ms help calm the nervous system and by heating your pillow in a microwave\
 , you can warm your bed or soothe sore muscles! Can be done as a standalon
 e workshop\, or attend our natural dyeing workshop on 10/21 in Cowpie from
  4-6pm to create your own fabric!
