DESCRIPTION:HCCA is sponsoring our third annual Chili Cook Off contest on 
 Sunday\, November 1 at 6 pm . You are invited to participate in one of two
  ways: As a chef entering your own homemade chili or as a judge to help se
 lect the winning entries. There will be Chili's Restaurant gift cards for 
 first ($40)\, second ($20) and third ($10) place winners\, based on the fa
 vorites selected by the tasting judges\, along with other prizes. Event re
 gistration is requested (select Chef or Tasting Judge). Entry is free! We 
 will be accepting donations and selling baked goods so don't forget to bri
 ng a little cash with you. There's no better way to spend a fall evening t
 han eating homemade chili with your neighbors!
