BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-festive-card-decoration/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T130000
DTSTAMP:20261014T154538Z
CREATED:20261014T154538Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T154538Z
UID:1778780020241-1796292000-1796302800@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Handmade Holiday: Festive Card Decoration
DESCRIPTION:Handmade Holiday: Festive Card Decoration\nwith Shoshana Avree \nThursday\, December 3  |  10 am – 1 pm \nRegister Here!\nDuring this hands-on workshop\, we will create holiday themed cards using stencils\, acrylics\, glitter pens\, and other basic art supplies. These cards and envelopes can be customized for any occasion and be as colorful\, simple\, or intricate as you desire. All materials are included and you can expect to take home around 10 decorated cards and envelopes. \nShoshana Avree has been a potter for over 30 years focusing on whimsical creations. Over the years\, she has taught both adults and children and is an active volunteer at the NC Arboretum helping in a variety of roles. \n●  Pre-registration is required for all classes unless otherwise detailed above. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! Or join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-festive-card-decoration/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Eventbrite-Banner-Template-8.png
END:VEVENT
